    "hlen": "scapy derives the hardware-address size from hwlen, so the value changes the header size; the crosscheck sentinel verifies the wire bytes",
    "plen": "scapy derives the protocol-address size from plen, so the value changes the header size; the crosscheck sentinel verifies the wire bytes",
    "sender_mac": "6-byte MAC fields take no integer probe sentinel (scapy builds MACs from strings); the wire bytes are crosscheck-verified",
    "target_mac": "6-byte MAC fields take no integer probe sentinel (scapy builds MACs from strings); the wire bytes are crosscheck-verified"
